      "description": "One-loop four-point box with one off-shell external leg ($p_2^2 = m^2$) in the parametric representation. Second Symanzik $F = \\alpha_1 \\alpha_3 s + \\alpha_2 \\alpha_4 t + \\alpha_2 \\alpha_3 m^2$. Two degree-2 annihilators $A_{2,1}$ and $A_{2,2}$ together with the Euler homogeneity operator generate the D-module of holonomic rank $r=4$, with singular locus $s t m^2 (s-m^2)(t-m^2)(s+t-m^2)$. A factorized fourth-order Picard-Fuchs operator in $d-s$ with a double factor is derived; no explicit MPL evaluation.",
