      "description": "Scalar one-loop box integral $D_0(s_1,s_2,q^2)$ with four massless internal propagators and one off-shell external leg ($p_1^2=p_2^2=p_3^2=0, q^2=(p_1+p_2+p_3)^2 \\neq 0$). Computed in $d=4-2\\varepsilon$ via Feynman parametrization with a factorization that decouples into 1D integrals, giving an all-order epsilon expansion in single-valued polylogarithms. The $+i0$ prescription is kept explicit so real and imaginary parts are determined in all kinematic regions. Appendix A handles vanishing Mandelstam limits.",
